domain OpenRangeCodegen

// Open-ended range constraint with NO writers (property never assigned in any
// action): ComputeVerifiedRanges marks it verified, so storage/transport project
// the "verified envelope". What do the CHECK constraint and [Range] attribute
// look like when the envelope's null bound was converted to 0?

Account: entity {
  Balance: Number range(100, )
  Score: Number range(, 50)
}
